Magic Lantern
-------------

Soup Engine runs inside Magic Lantern on supported Canon EOS bodies.
Classic packages ship a patched Magic Lantern AUTOEXEC.BIN. Film-in-ML
packages ship a Magic Lantern AUTOEXEC.BIN rebuilt with Soup Engine's
Film page overlay.

