Independent JPEG Group
----------------------

The JPEG encode and decode paths use algorithms derived from the
Independent JPEG Group's "islow" DCT and related Annex K / libjpeg
practices. This software is based in part on the work of the
Independent JPEG Group.

Colour matrices
---------------

Camera colour matrices in the CR2 reader match publicly documented
Adobe / dcraw XYZ-to-camera values. No Adobe, dcraw, or Canon source
code is included.

